          "name": "[m]_get",
          "methods": [
            {
              "textRaw": "get(propName, defaultValue?)",
              "type": "method",
              "name": "get",
              "desc": "<p><strong><code>6.6.0</code></strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>propName</strong> { <a href=\"dataTypes#string\">string</a> }</li>\n<li><strong>[ defaultValue ]</strong> { <a href=\"dataTypes#string\">string</a> }</li>\n<li><ins><strong>returns</strong></ins> { <a href=\"dataTypes#string\">string</a> | null }</li>\n</ul>\n<p>读取字符串系统属性.</p>\n<pre><code class=\"lang-js\">console.log(sysprops.get(&#39;ro.product.model&#39;));\n</code></pre>\n",
              "signatures": [
